@startuml CU13_Convertir_Clase_Asociacion
title Communication Diagram — CU-13: Convertir Relación en Clase de Asociación

' Objetos
object ":Usuario" as user
object ":DiagramPage\n(React)" as diagram
object ":RelationInspector\n(React)" as relInspector
object ":AssociationClassModal\n(React)" as modal
object ":useClassesAndDetails\n(Hook)" as classHook
object ":useRelations\n(Hook)" as relHook
object ":classes.js\n(API Client)" as classesApi
object ":relations.js\n(API Client)" as relApi
object ":AxiosClient" as axios
object ":ClassesRouter\n(FastAPI)" as classRouter
object ":RelacionRouter\n(FastAPI)" as relRouter
object ":Clase\n(SQLAlchemy)" as claseModel
object ":Relacion\n(SQLAlchemy)" as relModel
object ":PostgreSQL" as db
object ":realtime_events" as rtEvents
object ":WSManager" as wsManager
object ":Otros Clientes" as others

' === Precondición: existe relación M:N entre A y B ===

' === Paso 1: Seleccionar relación candidata ===
user --> diagram : 1: click en relación M:N\nentre ClaseA y ClaseB
diagram --> relInspector : 1.1: render RelationInspector\ncon botón "Convertir a\nClase de Asociación"
user --> relInspector : 1.2: click "Convertir a\nClase de Asociación"
relInspector --> modal : 1.3: render AssociationClassModal\ncon preview de la conversión

' === Paso 2: Confirmar conversión ===
user --> modal : 2: confirma conversión

' === Paso 3: Crear clase intermedia ===
modal --> classHook : 3: createAssociationClass(\n{nameA, nameB, xGrid, yGrid})
classHook --> classesApi : 3.1: createClass(diagramId,\n{name: "ClaseA_ClaseB",\nx_grid: avg(A.x, B.x),\ny_grid: avg(A.y, B.y) + 4})
classesApi --> axios : 3.2: POST /diagrams/{id}/classes
axios --> classRouter : 3.3: HTTP POST
classRouter --> claseModel : 3.4: Clase(nombre, diagram_id, x, y)
claseModel --> db : 3.5: INSERT INTO clase
classRouter --> rtEvents : 3.6: notify("class.created")
rtEvents --> wsManager : 3.7: broadcast
wsManager --> others : 3.8: WebSocket event
classRouter --> axios : 3.9: HTTP 201 ClaseCompletaOut\n(intermedia)
axios --> modal : 3.10: intermedia {id, name, ...}

' === Paso 4: Crear relación A → Intermedia (1:N) ===
modal --> relHook : 4: createRelation({from: A.id,\nto: intermedia.id,\ntype: "ASSOCIATION",\nsrc: 1..1, dst: 0..*,\nes_clase_asociacion: true})
relHook --> relApi : 4.1: createRelation(diagramId, params)
relApi --> axios : 4.2: POST /diagrams/{id}/relations
axios --> relRouter : 4.3: HTTP POST
relRouter --> relModel : 4.4: Relacion(origen=A,\ndestino=intermedia,\ntipo=ASSOCIATION,\nes_clase_asociacion=true)
relModel --> db : 4.5: INSERT INTO relacion
relRouter --> rtEvents : 4.6: notify("relation.created")
rtEvents --> wsManager : 4.7: broadcast
relRouter --> axios : 4.8: HTTP 201 RelacionOut

' === Paso 5: Crear relación Intermedia → B (N:1) ===
modal --> relHook : 5: createRelation({from: intermedia.id,\nto: B.id,\ntype: "ASSOCIATION",\nsrc: 0..*, dst: 1..1,\nes_clase_asociacion: true})
relHook --> relApi : 5.1: createRelation(diagramId, params)
relApi --> axios : 5.2: POST /diagrams/{id}/relations
axios --> relRouter : 5.3: HTTP POST
relRouter --> relModel : 5.4: Relacion(origen=intermedia,\ndestino=B,\ntipo=ASSOCIATION,\nes_clase_asociacion=true)
relModel --> db : 5.5: INSERT INTO relacion
relRouter --> rtEvents : 5.6: notify("relation.created")
rtEvents --> wsManager : 5.7: broadcast

' === Paso 6: Eliminar relación M:N original ===
modal --> relApi : 6: deleteRelation(originalRelId)
relApi --> axios : 6.1: DELETE /diagrams/relations/{relId}
axios --> relRouter : 6.2: HTTP DELETE
relRouter --> relModel : 6.3: delete(relacion original)
relModel --> db : 6.4: DELETE FROM relacion
relRouter --> rtEvents : 6.5: notify("relation.deleted")
rtEvents --> wsManager : 6.6: broadcast
wsManager --> others : 6.7: WebSocket event

' === Resultado final ===
modal --> diagram : 7: refresh diagram view
diagram --> diagram : 7.1: render: ClaseA ---- Intermedia ---- ClaseB\n(líneas punteadas, UML 2.5\nassociation class notation)

@enduml
